## Standard

This repository follows `standards/observability/slos-as-code.md` v1.0.0.

## Layout

- `prometheus/rules/slo-burn.yaml` — recording rules and multi-window burn-rate alerts
- `RUNBOOK.md` — operator runbook (owner, escalation, dashboards, rollback, game-day)

Pair with `monitors-as-code-generic` for symptom alerts and `dashboards-as-code-generic`
for golden-signal dashboards.

## Usage

Deploy `prometheus/rules/` to your Prometheus-compatible ruler (Mimir, AMP, Prometheus
Operator, Thanos Ruler). Alerts reference **{{ notification_target }}** via your
Alertmanager GitOps config.

## Validate locally

```bash
yamllint .
promtool check rules prometheus/rules/*.yaml
```

